WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Dad wants us to pick
up where he left off --

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Saving people, hunting things.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
The family business.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
I have these nightmares,
and sometimes they come true.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Come again?

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
I dreamt about jessica's
death before it happened.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
A vision. Started out as nightmares.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Then he started having
them while he was awake.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
The closer I get to anything involving
the demon, the stronger the visions get.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
The demon said he had plans
for me and the children like me.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Do you have any idea
what he meant by that?

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
No,I don'T.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Max,your abilities -They started
six,seven months ago,right?

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
How'd you know that?

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
'Cause that's when my abilities started.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
The same thing killed our mothers.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
You and I are chosen.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
For what? I don't know.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
The thing I don't get is why.
I guess because we're so alike?

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Max is nothing like you.
Sam,max is a monster.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
He's already killed two people.
Now he's gunning for a third.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Did he say anything to you?

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
No.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Nothing.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Hello? Yeah.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
All right.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Afternoon,dennis. Hey,doc.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
I'd like to look at a gun.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Yeah,right,doc.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Seriously?

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
That one.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Okay.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
That's a turkey hunter.
12-Gauge. Pump-Action.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Don't leave enough turkey
behind,if you ask me.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
What,uh,what sort of shells does it use?

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Right here.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
I'm taking the boys up to the
cabin this weekend,if you're,uh...

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.913
I mean,if you think you might
like to take up the sport.

00:00:03.363 --> 00:00:05.003
Thanks,but no.

00:00:05.293 --> 00:00:07.543
You know guns make me
nervous. Always have.

00:00:07.543 --> 00:00:09.433
This one goes in here, right?

00:00:09.433 --> 00:00:13.663
Whoa. Doc! No,no,you can't load a
weapon on the premises. It's illegal!

00:00:13.983 --> 00:00:15.253
It's okay,dennis. No,no.

00:00:15.253 --> 00:00:19.893
It's okay,dennis. It's all gonna be

00:00:21.093 --> 00:00:21.653
Okay.

00:00:21.653 --> 00:00:23.053
Doc!

00:00:24.113 --> 00:00:25.683
What's going on?

00:00:25.683 --> 00:00:29.153
No,no,it's okay. It's okay.

00:00:29.713 --> 00:00:33.543
It's all gonna be... okay.

00:00:50.963 --> 00:00:53.343
Sam,come on,zip it up. Let's hit the...

00:00:53.863 --> 00:00:55.623
Road.

00:00:55.993 --> 00:00:57.083
What?

00:01:13.363 --> 00:01:16.373
I don't know,man. Why don't we
just chill out,think about this?

00:01:18.853 --> 00:01:20.163
What's there to think about?

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:22.513
Just don't know if going to the
roadhouse is the smartest idea.

00:01:22.513 --> 00:01:24.623
Dean,it's another
premonition. I know it.

00:01:24.623 --> 00:01:28.863
This is gonna happen,and ash can tell us where.
Plus it could have some connection with the demon.

00:01:28.863 --> 00:01:31.183
My visions always do. That's my point.

00:01:31.183 --> 00:01:33.093
There's gonna be hunters
there. I don't know if --

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:36.003
If going in and announcing that
you're some supernatural freak

00:01:36.003 --> 00:01:39.203
With a demonic connection
is the best thing,okay?

00:01:40.083 --> 00:01:42.063
So I'm a freak now?

00:01:43.673 --> 00:01:45.533
You've always been a freak.

00:01:58.443 --> 00:02:00.653
Damn, little lady,
that was my room money.

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:03.173
Then I guess you're
taking a truck nap tonight.

00:02:03.873 --> 00:02:06.693
I'd have checked the high scores
before you put your money down.

00:02:08.193 --> 00:02:10.433
Went and got yourself hustled,ed.

00:02:20.783 --> 00:02:22.603
Just can't stay away,huh?

00:02:23.483 --> 00:02:25.193
Yeah,looks like. How you doing,jo?

00:02:25.193 --> 00:02:27.293
Where's ash? In his back room.

00:02:27.293 --> 00:02:29.313
Great. And I'm fine.

00:02:30.653 --> 00:02:33.433
Sorry. He's -We're kind
of on a bit of a timetable.

00:02:42.363 --> 00:02:43.423
Ash?

00:02:43.423 --> 00:02:46.833
The conditions that led to
the sharpsville tragedy...

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:49.003
Hey,ash?

00:02:51.813 --> 00:02:53.733
Hey,dr. Badass?

00:02:57.393 --> 00:03:00.063
Sam. Dean.

00:03:00.593 --> 00:03:02.723
Sam and dean.

00:03:04.503 --> 00:03:07.953
Hey,ash, um,we need your help.

00:03:07.953 --> 00:03:11.273
Hell,then, guess I need my pants.

00:03:14.823 --> 00:03:19.593
So,I got a match. It's the logo
for the blue ridge bus lines.

00:03:19.593 --> 00:03:21.543
Guthrie,oklahoma.

00:03:21.543 --> 00:03:26.053
Okay. Do me a favor. Check guthrie for any
demonic signs or omens or anything like that.

00:03:26.053 --> 00:03:28.783
You think the demon is there?

00:03:29.673 --> 00:03:30.863
Yeah. Maybe.

00:03:30.863 --> 00:03:34.353
Why would you think that?
Just check it,all right?

00:03:37.953 --> 00:03:40.893
No,sir,nothing. No demon.

00:03:42.473 --> 00:03:44.723
All right. Try something else for me.

00:03:44.723 --> 00:03:48.053
Search guthrie for a house
fire. It would be 1983.

00:03:48.053 --> 00:03:52.193
Fire's origin would be a baby's nursery,
night of the kid's 6-Month birthday.

00:03:57.213 --> 00:04:00.263
Okay,now, that is just weird,man.

00:04:00.263 --> 00:04:03.173
Why the hell would i
be looking for that?

00:04:06.003 --> 00:04:07.683
'Cause there's a pbr in it for you.

00:04:07.683 --> 00:04:10.333
Give me 15 minutes.

00:04:35.923 --> 00:04:37.203
What?

00:04:37.203 --> 00:04:39.743
R.E.O. Speedwagon? Damn right,R.E.O.

00:04:40.133 --> 00:04:41.973
Kevin cronin sings it from the heart.

00:04:41.973 --> 00:04:44.623
He sings it from the
hair. There's a difference.

00:04:48.893 --> 00:04:51.213
That profile you've got ash looking for?

00:04:52.303 --> 00:04:54.553
Your mom died the
same way, didn't she --

00:04:54.553 --> 00:04:57.013
The fire in sam's nursery?

00:04:57.543 --> 00:05:00.553
Look,jo,it's kind of a
family thing. I could help.

00:05:00.553 --> 00:05:04.113
I'm sure you could,but we got
to handle this one ourselves.

00:05:04.833 --> 00:05:08.203
Besides,if I ran off with you,
think your mother might kill me.

00:05:11.323 --> 00:05:13.053
You're afraid of my mother?

00:05:13.053 --> 00:05:14.883
I think so.

00:05:15.353 --> 00:05:16.833
We have a match. We got to go.

00:05:16.833 --> 00:05:19.443
All right,jo, see you later.

00:05:23.963 --> 00:05:29.283
And even as I wander
I'm keeping you in sight

00:05:29.763 --> 00:05:36.033
You're a candle in the window
on a cold,dark winter's night

00:05:36.033 --> 00:05:41.163
And I'm getting closer
than I ever thought

00:05:41.163 --> 00:05:43.193
I mi-Ight

00:05:43.193 --> 00:05:46.053
You're kidding,right?

00:05:46.853 --> 00:05:50.383
I heard the song somewhere. I can't get it out
of my head. I don't know,man. What do you got?

00:05:53.513 --> 00:05:55.093
Andrew gallagher.

00:05:55.093 --> 00:05:58.543
Born in '83,like me.

00:05:58.543 --> 00:06:01.503
Lost his mother in a nursery
fire exactly six months later,

00:06:01.503 --> 00:06:02.673
Also like me.

00:06:02.673 --> 00:06:04.363
You think the demon killed his mom?

00:06:04.363 --> 00:06:05.263
Sure looks like it.

00:06:05.263 --> 00:06:06.553
How did you know to look for this guy?

00:06:06.553 --> 00:06:08.723
Every premonition I've had,
if they're not about the demon,

00:06:08.723 --> 00:06:11.093
They're about the other
kids the demon visited.

00:06:11.093 --> 00:06:12.453
Like max miller. Remember him?

00:06:12.453 --> 00:06:15.063
Yeah,but max miller was
a basic little psycho.

00:06:15.063 --> 00:06:18.403
Point is he was killing people,and I was
having the same type of visions about him.

00:06:18.403 --> 00:06:21.063
And now it could be happening all
over again with this gallagher guy.

00:06:21.063 --> 00:06:22.593
How do we find him? I don't know.

00:06:22.593 --> 00:06:25.133
No current address,
no current employment.

00:06:25.133 --> 00:06:28.363
Still owes money on all his
bills -Phone,credit,utilities.

00:06:28.363 --> 00:06:30.343
Collection agency flags?

00:06:30.343 --> 00:06:31.823
Not in the system.

00:06:31.823 --> 00:06:33.523
They just let him take a walk?

00:06:33.523 --> 00:06:35.273
Seems like it.

00:06:35.273 --> 00:06:39.013
There's a work address from
his last w-2 about a year ago.

00:06:39.013 --> 00:06:41.063
Let's start there.

00:06:47.793 --> 00:06:51.453
You won't get anything out of
andy,guys. I'm sorry,but they never do.

00:06:52.143 --> 00:06:53.113
"They"?

00:06:53.113 --> 00:06:55.373
You're debt collectors, right?

00:06:55.373 --> 00:06:57.373
Once in a while, they come by.

00:06:57.373 --> 00:07:00.873
I don't know what andy says to
them, but they never come back.

00:07:01.593 --> 00:07:05.363
Actually,we're lawyers
representing his great-Aunt lita.

00:07:05.363 --> 00:07:09.273
She passed -God rest her soul
-But left andy a sizable estate.

00:07:09.273 --> 00:07:12.293
Yeah. So,are you a friend of his?

00:07:12.293 --> 00:07:15.763
I used to be,yeah. I don't
see much of andy anymore.

00:07:15.763 --> 00:07:19.303
Andy? Andy kicks ass,man. Is that right?

00:07:19.303 --> 00:07:21.213
Yeah. Andy can get you into anything.

00:07:21.213 --> 00:07:24.143
He even got me backstage at
aerosmith once. It was beautiful,bro.

00:07:24.873 --> 00:07:27.553
How about busing a table or two,webber?

00:07:28.433 --> 00:07:30.883
Yeah,you bet,boss.

00:07:31.783 --> 00:07:34.493
Look,if you want to find
him, try orchard street.

00:07:34.493 --> 00:07:37.823
Just look for a van with the
barbarian queen painted on the side.

00:07:38.213 --> 00:07:39.343
Barbarian queen.

00:07:39.343 --> 00:07:42.493
She's riding a polar bear.
It's kind of hard to miss.

00:07:47.223 --> 00:07:50.483
I'm sorry. I'm starting to like
this dude. That van is sweet.

00:07:54.683 --> 00:07:57.473
What's wrong? Nothing.

00:07:57.473 --> 00:07:59.923
Sam,you look like you're
sucking on a lemon.

00:07:59.923 --> 00:08:03.803
This andrew gallagher -He's the
second guy like this we've found,dean.

00:08:04.143 --> 00:08:06.783
Demon came to them when they were
kids. Now they're killing people.

00:08:06.783 --> 00:08:09.243
We don't know what andrew
gallagher is. Could be innocent.

00:08:09.243 --> 00:08:10.773
My visions haven't been wrong yet.

00:08:10.773 --> 00:08:12.373
What's your point?

00:08:12.373 --> 00:08:15.463
My point is I'm one
of them. No,you're not.

00:08:15.463 --> 00:08:18.373
Dean,the demon said he had plans
for me and children like me.

00:08:18.373 --> 00:08:19.303
Yeah?

00:08:19.303 --> 00:08:23.273
Maybe this is his plan. Maybe
we're all a bunch of psychic freaks.

00:08:23.273 --> 00:08:25.043
Maybe we're all
supposed to be --

00:08:25.043 --> 00:08:26.003
Killers? Yeah.

00:08:26.003 --> 00:08:28.953
So the demon wants you out
there,killing with your minds?

00:08:29.453 --> 00:08:31.923
Give me a break. You're
not a murderer,sam!

00:08:31.923 --> 00:08:34.463
You don't have it in your bones.

00:08:35.173 --> 00:08:36.883
No?

00:08:38.353 --> 00:08:40.373
Last I checked, I kill
all kinds of things.

00:08:40.373 --> 00:08:42.703
Those things were asking for it.

00:08:42.703 --> 00:08:44.943
There's a difference.

00:08:57.883 --> 00:08:59.693
Got him.

00:09:27.233 --> 00:09:29.803
That's him,that older
guy. He's the shooter.

00:09:31.433 --> 00:09:34.253
Well,you keep on him.
I'll stick with andy.

00:10:21.973 --> 00:10:24.133
Hey! Hey.

00:10:24.133 --> 00:10:27.203
This is a cherry ride. Yeah. Thanks.

00:10:27.203 --> 00:10:31.453
Man,you know,'67 -Impala's
best year,if you ask me.

00:10:32.013 --> 00:10:33.243
This is a serious classic.

00:10:33.243 --> 00:10:37.093
You know,I just rebuilt her,too.
Can't let a car like this one go.

00:10:37.093 --> 00:10:38.773
Damn straight.

00:10:38.773 --> 00:10:41.663
Hey. Could I have it? Sure,man.

00:10:43.003 --> 00:10:44.963
Sweet.

00:10:44.963 --> 00:10:49.593
Hop right in there.
There you go. Very nice.

00:10:50.043 --> 00:10:52.283
Take it easy. All right.

00:11:05.143 --> 00:11:07.843
Hello? Yeah.

00:11:56.803 --> 00:11:59.863
Hello? Yeah.

00:12:02.673 --> 00:12:03.923
Dean, andy's got the impala!

00:12:03.923 --> 00:12:07.583
I know! He just sort of asked
me for it, and I let him take it.

00:12:07.583 --> 00:12:08.373
You what?

00:12:08.373 --> 00:12:12.013
He full-On obi-Wan'd me.
It's mind control,man.

00:12:30.853 --> 00:12:33.233
I kept him out of the gun store.

00:12:35.503 --> 00:12:37.673
I thought he was okay.

00:12:38.983 --> 00:12:41.363
I thought he was past it. At least...

00:12:42.863 --> 00:12:45.123
I should've stayed with him.

00:12:48.033 --> 00:12:50.663
Andy! What's up,dog?

00:12:52.263 --> 00:12:54.033
Andy.

00:12:54.923 --> 00:12:57.003
What are you doing here?

00:12:57.003 --> 00:13:00.653
D-Dr. Jennings.

00:13:01.073 --> 00:13:03.223
He's dead.

00:13:03.823 --> 00:13:06.523
Oh,no,I-I'm sorry.

00:13:06.523 --> 00:13:08.893
I don't know. I-I...

00:13:10.213 --> 00:13:14.753
I just -I was upset,
and I wanted to see you.

00:13:15.573 --> 00:13:19.283
Well,I'm glad you did. I,um...

00:13:21.803 --> 00:13:24.313
I missed you.

00:13:28.673 --> 00:13:32.113
Oh,you know what? Some guys were
here this morning,looking for you.

00:13:33.423 --> 00:13:35.503
What guys?

00:13:39.833 --> 00:13:41.723
Thank god!

00:13:44.333 --> 00:13:47.543
I'm sorry,baby. I'll
never leave you again.

00:13:50.843 --> 00:13:52.423
At least he left the keys in it.

00:13:52.423 --> 00:13:55.193
Yeah. Real samaritan,this guy.

00:13:55.193 --> 00:13:59.183
It looks like he can't work his mojo just by
twitching his nose. He's got to use verbal commands.

00:13:59.183 --> 00:14:02.943
The doctor had just gotten off his cellphone
when he stepped in front of that bus.

00:14:04.873 --> 00:14:06.893
Andy must've called him or something.

00:14:07.663 --> 00:14:10.254
I don't know. Maybe. Beg your pardon?

00:14:10.254 --> 00:14:11.683
I just don't know if he's our guy,sam.

00:14:11.683 --> 00:14:15.283
You had O.J. Convicted before he got out of
his bronco,and you have doubts about this?

00:14:15.283 --> 00:14:18.143
He doesn't seem like the
stone-Cold killer type. That's all.

00:14:18.143 --> 00:14:19.653
And O.J. Was guilty.

00:14:19.653 --> 00:14:22.073
Either way,how are we
gonna track this guy down?

00:14:24.113 --> 00:14:25.813
Not a problem.

00:14:27.153 --> 00:14:29.943
Not exactly an inconspicuous ride.

00:14:30.933 --> 00:14:32.393
Let's have a look.

00:14:38.733 --> 00:14:40.754
Oh,come on.

00:14:41.213 --> 00:14:45.313
This is -This is magnificent.
That's what this is.

00:14:46.043 --> 00:14:49.233
Not exactly a serial
killer's lair,though.

00:14:49.233 --> 00:14:52.803
There's no clown paintings on the walls

00:14:52.803 --> 00:14:55.383
Or scissors stuck in victims' photos.

00:14:55.383 --> 00:14:57.453
I like the tiger.

00:14:57.453 --> 00:15:00.303
Hegel? Kant?

00:15:00.303 --> 00:15:03.264
Wittgenstein? That's some
pretty heavy reading,dean.

00:15:03.264 --> 00:15:05.703
Yeah,and,uh...

00:15:05.703 --> 00:15:08.553
Moby dick's bong.

00:15:18.463 --> 00:15:21.193
You know,one day I'd
love to just sit down

00:15:21.193 --> 00:15:23.983
And eat something that I didn't
have to microwave at a minimart.

00:15:24.583 --> 00:15:27.843
What I don't get is the motive.
The doctor was squeaky clean.

00:15:27.843 --> 00:15:29.403
Why would andy waste him?

00:15:29.403 --> 00:15:31.043
If it is andy.

00:15:31.043 --> 00:15:33.093
Dude,enough. Why?

00:15:33.093 --> 00:15:35.533
The doctor was mind-Controlled
in front of a bus.

00:15:35.533 --> 00:15:38.913
Andy just happens to have the power
of mind control. You do the math.

00:15:38.913 --> 00:15:40.603
I don't think the guy has it in him.

00:15:40.603 --> 00:15:41.873
How the hell would you know?

00:15:41.873 --> 00:15:43.463
Why are you bending over
backwards defending him?

00:15:43.463 --> 00:15:44.543
'Cause you're not right about this.

00:15:44.543 --> 00:15:46.153
About andy?

00:15:46.833 --> 00:15:48.643
Hey! You think I haven't seen you two?

00:15:48.643 --> 00:15:51.163
Why are you following me?

00:15:51.433 --> 00:15:53.463
Well,we're lawyers. A
relative of yours has --

00:15:53.463 --> 00:15:56.494
Tell the truth!
That's what --

00:15:56.573 --> 00:15:59.283
We hunt demons. What?

00:15:59.283 --> 00:16:02.963
Demons and spirits. Things your
worst nightmares wouldn't even touch.

00:16:02.963 --> 00:16:04.733
Sam's my brother. Dean,shut up.

00:16:04.733 --> 00:16:07.774
I'm trying. He's psychic,like
you. Well,not really like you.

00:16:07.774 --> 00:16:09.233
He thinks you're a murderer,

00:16:09.233 --> 00:16:12.774
And he's afraid he's gonna become one himself
cause you're all part of something that's terrible.

00:16:12.774 --> 00:16:16.403
I hope to hell that he's wrong, but I'm
starting to get scared he might be right.

00:16:16.754 --> 00:16:19.683
Okay,you know what? Just leave me alone.

00:16:20.073 --> 00:16:21.873
All right?

00:16:24.083 --> 00:16:27.713
What are you doing?
Look,I-I said,leave me alone.

00:16:27.713 --> 00:16:30.723
Get out of here! Just start
driving and never stop!

00:16:30.723 --> 00:16:32.733
Doesn't seem to work on me,andy.

00:16:32.733 --> 00:16:34.093
What?

00:16:34.933 --> 00:16:36.693
You can make people
do things, can't you?

00:16:36.693 --> 00:16:38.553
You can tell them what to think.

00:16:39.663 --> 00:16:40.563
That's crazy.

00:16:40.613 --> 00:16:42.783
All started a year ago, didn't it?

00:16:42.783 --> 00:16:46.613
After you turned 22. Little stuff at first,
then you got better at controlling it.

00:16:46.613 --> 00:16:47.783
How do you know all this?

00:16:47.783 --> 00:16:51.333
'Cause the same thing happened to
me,andy. My mom died in a fire,too.

00:16:51.333 --> 00:16:53.913
I have abilities,too.

00:16:53.913 --> 00:16:55.373
You see,we're connected, you and me.

00:16:55.373 --> 00:16:57.453
Just -Just get out of here!

00:16:57.453 --> 00:17:00.133
Why did you tell the doctor
to walk in front of a bus?

00:17:00.133 --> 00:17:01.933
What?

00:17:09.264 --> 00:17:11.653
Why did you kill him? I didn'T.

00:17:20.014 --> 00:17:21.603
Hello?

00:17:23.623 --> 00:17:25.193
Sure.

00:17:26.014 --> 00:17:27.813
I can do that.

00:17:56.673 --> 00:17:58.264
Hey!

00:17:58.683 --> 00:18:00.983
Lady,what are you doing?!
It's gonna be okay.

00:18:02.253 --> 00:18:03.873
Lady,no. No!

00:18:16.083 --> 00:18:18.183
Sam? What is it?

00:18:18.183 --> 00:18:20.143
I didn't do anything to him.

00:18:23.364 --> 00:18:25.594
A woman. A woman burning alive.

00:18:25.594 --> 00:18:26.324
What else you get?

00:18:26.324 --> 00:18:28.683
A gas station. A woman
is gonna kill herself.

00:18:28.683 --> 00:18:30.114
What does he mean, "going to"?

00:18:30.114 --> 00:18:31.844
Shut up.

00:18:32.153 --> 00:18:34.094
She gets triggered
by a call on her cell.

00:18:34.094 --> 00:18:35.933
When? I don't know.

00:18:35.933 --> 00:18:38.603
As long as we keep our eyes on this
son of a bitch,he can't hurt her.

00:18:38.603 --> 00:18:40.773
I didn't hurt anybody! Yeah,not yet.

00:18:47.284 --> 00:18:48.784
Go.

00:18:49.233 --> 00:18:50.903
No. Not you.

00:18:51.083 --> 00:18:53.333
You're staying here with me.

00:18:55.903 --> 00:18:58.903
Hey,it's me. She's dead.
Burned up,just like you said.

00:18:59.963 --> 00:19:00.793
When?

00:19:00.793 --> 00:19:03.393
Minutes before I got here.
The smell hasn't even cleared.

00:19:03.393 --> 00:19:05.703
What's up with your visions?
This wasn't even a head start.

00:19:05.703 --> 00:19:08.534
I can't control them. I don't
know what the hell is going on.

00:19:08.534 --> 00:19:11.733
You were with andy when this whole
thing went down,so it can't be him.

00:19:11.733 --> 00:19:13.324
It's got to be somebody else.

00:19:13.324 --> 00:19:14.364
That doesn't make any sense.

00:19:14.364 --> 00:19:17.423
What else is new? I'll dig around
here, see what else I can find.

00:19:22.723 --> 00:19:27.213
You get these premonitions
of people about to die?

00:19:28.543 --> 00:19:30.483
That's impossible.

00:19:32.423 --> 00:19:34.893
A lot of people would say the
same thing about what you do.

00:19:36.853 --> 00:19:38.503
Death visions? Yeah.

00:19:38.913 --> 00:19:40.563
Dude,that sucks.

00:19:40.563 --> 00:19:44.203
When I got my mind
thing, it was like a gift.

00:19:44.203 --> 00:19:45.643
It was like I won the lotto.

00:19:45.643 --> 00:19:48.344
But you still live in a van.

00:19:48.923 --> 00:19:52.114
I don't get it. You could
have anything you ever wanted.

00:19:53.423 --> 00:19:57.014
Yeah,but I-I got everything I need.

00:20:00.313 --> 00:20:02.083
So you're really not a killer,huh?

00:20:02.083 --> 00:20:05.034
That's what I've been
trying to tell you.

00:20:06.304 --> 00:20:08.134
That's good.

00:20:08.134 --> 00:20:10.423
That means there's hope for both of us.

00:20:17.673 --> 00:20:20.563
Victim's name was holly
beckett. 41. Single.

00:20:20.563 --> 00:20:22.973
Who is she? Never heard of her.

00:20:22.973 --> 00:20:25.663
I called ash on the way over. He
came up with a little something.

00:20:26.023 --> 00:20:30.223
Apparently holly beckett gave birth
when she was 18 years old,back in 1983 --

00:20:30.223 --> 00:20:32.594
Same day you were born,andy.

00:20:33.744 --> 00:20:36.134
Andy, were you adopted?

00:20:36.364 --> 00:20:37.333
Well,yeah.

00:20:37.333 --> 00:20:40.543
You were? And you
neglected to mention that?

00:20:40.893 --> 00:20:44.983
It never really came up. I mean,I
never knew my birth parents,

00:20:44.983 --> 00:20:48.923
And,like you said, my adopted
mom died when I was a baby.

00:20:48.923 --> 00:20:51.203
Do you think this holly
woman could actually be --

00:20:51.203 --> 00:20:55.364
I don't know. Tried to get a copy of the birth
records,but they're sealed in the county office.

00:20:56.713 --> 00:20:58.653
Well,screw that.

00:21:00.373 --> 00:21:02.603
Probably shouldn't have
let you kids in here.

00:21:02.603 --> 00:21:04.844
No. It'll all be fine, all right?

00:21:04.844 --> 00:21:07.534
Just go get a cup of coffee, all right?

00:21:07.923 --> 00:21:10.423
These aren't the droids
you're looking for.

00:21:11.054 --> 00:21:12.833
Awesome.

00:21:13.173 --> 00:21:14.494
I got it. Yeah?

00:21:14.494 --> 00:21:17.764
Yeah.

00:21:17.764 --> 00:21:19.833
Andy,it's true.

00:21:20.213 --> 00:21:23.514
Holly beckett was your birth mother.

00:21:25.193 --> 00:21:26.463
Does anyone have a vicodin?

00:21:26.463 --> 00:21:28.503
Dr. Jennings was her doctor,too.

00:21:28.503 --> 00:21:31.634
I mean, he oversaw the adoption.

00:21:31.983 --> 00:21:33.703
You have a solid
connection to both of them.

00:21:33.703 --> 00:21:36.333
Yeah,but I didn't kill
them. We believe you.

00:21:37.813 --> 00:21:40.413
Yeah. But,uh,who did?

00:21:40.413 --> 00:21:42.864
I think I got a pretty good guess.

00:21:43.844 --> 00:21:46.634
Holly beckett gave birth to twins.

00:21:47.873 --> 00:21:50.793
I have an evil twin.

00:21:51.503 --> 00:21:54.384
Holly put you and your
brother up for adoption.

00:21:54.384 --> 00:21:58.023
And you went to the
gallagher family,obviously,

00:21:58.023 --> 00:22:02.023
And your brother went to the
weems family from upstate.

00:22:03.453 --> 00:22:05.523
Andy,how you doing? Still with us?

00:22:07.433 --> 00:22:08.723
Um...what was my brother's name?

00:22:08.723 --> 00:22:12.393
Here. Um,ansem weems?

00:22:13.563 --> 00:22:16.114
He's got a local address. He lives here?

00:22:16.114 --> 00:22:17.784
Let's get a look at him.

00:22:17.784 --> 00:22:20.543
Got his picture coming
over from the dmv right now.

00:22:30.253 --> 00:22:33.094
Hate to kick you while you're freaked.

00:22:34.534 --> 00:22:36.473
Take a look at that.

00:22:40.413 --> 00:22:42.563
Hey,trace? Yeah?

00:22:44.213 --> 00:22:47.673
You and andy,you guys went
together for a while,didn't you?

00:22:48.233 --> 00:22:49.864
Yeah,webber,why?

00:22:49.864 --> 00:22:54.223
I don't know. Just wondering. I was
wondering how you felt about him these days.

00:22:54.223 --> 00:22:57.784
I mean,I've seen you guys together. It
seems like there's still something there.

00:22:59.403 --> 00:23:02.353
Were you guys ever, like,serious?

00:23:02.744 --> 00:23:04.554
Um...no.

00:23:04.554 --> 00:23:07.284
Come on,trace. Tell the truth.

00:23:10.244 --> 00:23:13.163
All right,andy,tell us everything
you know about this guy.

00:23:14.733 --> 00:23:19.973
I don't know much. Webber shows
up one day like eight months ago,

00:23:19.973 --> 00:23:22.123
Acting like he's my
best friend in the world.

00:23:22.123 --> 00:23:24.683
He's kind of weird,like
trying too hard,you know?

00:23:24.683 --> 00:23:26.403
He must've known you guys are twins.

00:23:26.403 --> 00:23:28.903
Why did he change his name?
Why not tell you the truth?

00:23:31.353 --> 00:23:32.913
Sam?

00:24:22.473 --> 00:24:23.824
Sam? Oh,god!

00:24:23.824 --> 00:24:25.744
Sam?!

00:24:26.134 --> 00:24:27.344
Sam!

00:24:30.333 --> 00:24:32.244
Hey. Hey!

00:24:44.653 --> 00:24:46.554
I take my ladies here.

00:24:48.413 --> 00:24:50.453
They like it.

00:24:51.364 --> 00:24:55.203
Well,I mean,I like it,
so,of course,they do,too.

00:24:58.833 --> 00:25:02.213
Please. I just want to go home.

00:25:02.213 --> 00:25:04.873
Stop crying.

00:25:06.713 --> 00:25:08.733
Hey.

00:25:10.844 --> 00:25:13.723
I get it. I see what you see in andy.

00:25:13.723 --> 00:25:17.014
I mean,he's a genius.
The books he reads --

00:25:17.014 --> 00:25:19.893
He's gonna be a great man someday.

00:25:22.824 --> 00:25:26.554
But he is my family, not yours.

00:25:27.293 --> 00:25:29.844
You can't have him.

00:25:29.844 --> 00:25:33.074
You're not gonna have
anything after tonight.

00:25:48.873 --> 00:25:50.143
Dean, you should stay back.

00:25:50.143 --> 00:25:53.273
No argument here. I had my head
screwed with enough for one day.

00:25:58.233 --> 00:26:01.523
I'm coming with
you. Andy --

00:26:01.523 --> 00:26:05.244
That's tracy out there, and I'm coming.

00:26:08.653 --> 00:26:11.884
Okay. Ch-Ch--
Slower.

00:26:16.543 --> 00:26:18.554
Tracy...

00:26:19.574 --> 00:26:22.873
I want you to listen to
me very carefully,okay?

00:26:24.723 --> 00:26:27.353
When we're done here

00:26:28.764 --> 00:26:33.933
I want you to head over to
the edge of that dam,okay?

00:26:36.023 --> 00:26:37.673
Okay.

00:26:39.293 --> 00:26:41.534
And when you get there

00:26:42.703 --> 00:26:45.173
You're gonna think you can fly.

00:26:47.403 --> 00:26:50.494
And you're just gonna step right off.

00:26:53.153 --> 00:26:55.753
You -You can fly,can't you?

00:26:58.264 --> 00:27:01.373
Yeah. I think so.

00:27:01.373 --> 00:27:03.114
You might get scared,

00:27:03.114 --> 00:27:06.983
But I want you to say that it's okay.

00:27:09.103 --> 00:27:14.554
Just tell yourself,
"everything is okay."

00:27:16.123 --> 00:27:18.333
Get out of the car! Now!

00:27:18.333 --> 00:27:20.693
You really don't want to do this.

00:27:22.563 --> 00:27:24.364
Trace,give me your hand.
Come here,come here.

00:27:24.364 --> 00:27:28.483
I couldn't control myself.

00:27:28.483 --> 00:27:31.443
Hey! Don't move. Don't move!

00:27:33.384 --> 00:27:35.034
No! No! I will kill you!

00:27:35.034 --> 00:27:36.554
Andy! Hey,hey,hey! No!
No! I'll handle this!

00:27:36.623 --> 00:27:39.873
I will kill you!

00:27:39.873 --> 00:27:42.723
Andy,listen to me! Just listen to me!

00:27:44.713 --> 00:27:48.393
Tracy,stop! I said,stop it!

00:27:59.813 --> 00:28:02.453
How did you do that? Practice,bro.

00:28:03.223 --> 00:28:05.773
If you just practiced, you would know.

00:28:05.773 --> 00:28:08.933
Sometimes... you don't
need to use your words.

00:28:08.933 --> 00:28:12.583
If you have to, all you need is this.

00:28:13.063 --> 00:28:14.603
Sometimes the headache is worth it.

00:28:14.603 --> 00:28:16.083
You twisted son of a bitch!

00:28:16.083 --> 00:28:19.304
Back off,andy! Or tracy is
gonna do a little flying.

00:28:26.873 --> 00:28:29.183
Aren't you,trace?

00:28:30.873 --> 00:28:34.054
I'm stronger than you. I can do it.

00:28:37.094 --> 00:28:39.753
Okay,okay. Okay.

00:28:39.753 --> 00:28:42.953
All right,just... please don't hurt her.

00:28:42.953 --> 00:28:46.163
Don't be mad at me,okay?
I know. It's all wrong.

00:28:46.163 --> 00:28:48.723
I didn't mean for this
to happen. It's just...

00:28:49.643 --> 00:28:51.853
Tracy
--

00:28:52.284 --> 00:28:54.643
She's trying to come between us.

00:28:54.643 --> 00:28:56.494
You're insane. She's garbage!

00:28:56.494 --> 00:28:58.253
Man,they all are!

00:28:58.253 --> 00:29:00.994
We can push them. We can
make them do whatever we want!

00:29:02.773 --> 00:29:05.853
Are you really -Are you
really this stupid? Is it --

00:29:06.833 --> 00:29:09.634
You learn you got a twin,

00:29:09.634 --> 00:29:12.153
You call him up, you go out for a drink.

00:29:12.153 --> 00:29:14.313
You don't start killing people!

00:29:14.313 --> 00:29:18.223
I wanted to tell you
for so long,bro,but...

00:29:19.643 --> 00:29:22.384
He didn't let me. He said I
had to wait until the time --

00:29:22.384 --> 00:29:24.804
Who? The man with the yellow eyes.

00:29:28.163 --> 00:29:29.313
What are you talking about?

00:29:29.313 --> 00:29:32.913
He came to me... in my dream.

00:29:34.384 --> 00:29:36.813
He said I was special.

00:29:37.284 --> 00:29:40.563
He told me he's got big plans for me.

00:29:40.563 --> 00:29:43.443
Wait till you see what's in
store,andy,for both of us.

00:29:44.873 --> 00:29:50.483
See,he's the one who told me
that I had a brother,a twin.

00:29:57.253 --> 00:29:59.333
Why did you kill our mother?

00:29:59.333 --> 00:30:01.023
And why dr. Jennings?

00:30:01.023 --> 00:30:03.733
Because they split us up!

00:30:04.373 --> 00:30:06.903
They ruined our lives, andy!

00:30:06.903 --> 00:30:10.043
We could've been
together this whole time

00:30:10.043 --> 00:30:12.653
Instead of alone.

00:30:13.344 --> 00:30:16.534
I couldn't let them do that. I
couldn't let them get away with that.

00:30:17.733 --> 00:30:19.534
No.

00:30:30.443 --> 00:30:33.103
I see you.

00:30:34.054 --> 00:30:36.353
Bye-Bye.

00:31:11.293 --> 00:31:13.594
He shot himself.

00:31:14.023 --> 00:31:16.534
And you all saw it happen.

00:31:17.894 --> 00:31:20.634
Yeah. We did.

00:31:21.434 --> 00:31:24.014
Look at him. He's getting better at it.

00:31:42.074 --> 00:31:44.014
She won't even look at me.

00:31:44.684 --> 00:31:46.963
Yeah, she's pretty shaken up.

00:31:46.963 --> 00:31:50.114
No,it's -This is different.

00:31:50.114 --> 00:31:52.244
This
is --

00:31:52.244 --> 00:31:56.684
I never used my mind thing on
her before,before last night.

00:31:59.153 --> 00:32:01.653
She's scared of me now.

00:32:06.264 --> 00:32:08.994
Andy,I hate to do this, but,um...

00:32:10.563 --> 00:32:13.213
We have to get out of here. Here.

00:32:13.684 --> 00:32:15.773
I wrote down my cell.

00:32:16.624 --> 00:32:22.423
You don't have to be alone in this,all right?
If anything comes up,you can call me up.

00:32:26.653 --> 00:32:31.954
Wh-What am I supposed to do now?

00:32:31.954 --> 00:32:34.304
You be good,andy...

00:32:34.713 --> 00:32:36.653
Or we'll be back.

00:32:44.624 --> 00:32:46.233
Looks like I was right.

00:32:46.233 --> 00:32:48.094
About what? Andy.

00:32:48.644 --> 00:32:51.063
He's a killer after all.

00:32:51.653 --> 00:32:54.624
No,he's a hero. He saved his
girlfriend's life. He saved my life.

00:32:54.624 --> 00:32:58.054
Bottom line, last night
he wasted somebody.

00:32:58.054 --> 00:33:00.724
Yeah,but he's not a
foaming-At-The-Mouth psycho.

00:33:00.724 --> 00:33:03.673
He was just -He was pushed into that.

00:33:03.673 --> 00:33:05.914
Webber was pushed,too, in his own way.

00:33:05.914 --> 00:33:08.653
Max miller was pushed. Hell,I
was pushed by jessica's death.

00:33:08.653 --> 00:33:09.684
What's your point,sam?

00:33:09.684 --> 00:33:12.423
Right circumstances, everyone
is capable of murder -Everyone.

00:33:13.514 --> 00:33:16.853
Maybe that's what the demon is doing
-Pushing us,finding ways to break us.

00:33:16.853 --> 00:33:19.543
We don't know what the demon wants,okay?

00:33:19.543 --> 00:33:21.644
Quit worrying about it.

00:33:22.644 --> 00:33:25.563
You know,I heard you before,dean,
when andy made you tell the truth.

00:33:26.094 --> 00:33:27.894
You're just as scared of this as I am.

00:33:27.894 --> 00:33:31.753
That was mind control! It's like
being roofied man. That doesn't count.

00:33:31.753 --> 00:33:34.503
No,I-I'm calling
do-Over. What are you,7?

00:33:34.503 --> 00:33:36.923
Doesn't matter. We just got
to keep doing what we're doing,

00:33:36.923 --> 00:33:39.114
Find that evil son of
a bitch, and kill it.

00:33:42.094 --> 00:33:44.074
Yeah. I guess.

00:33:46.583 --> 00:33:48.284
Hello?

00:33:49.144 --> 00:33:51.804
Ellen. What's going on?

00:33:53.914 --> 00:33:56.253
Yeah. We'll be right there.

00:34:03.144 --> 00:34:05.014
Jo?

00:34:05.014 --> 00:34:06.793
Go pull up another case of beer.

00:34:06.793 --> 00:34:09.034
Mom --
Now. Please?

00:34:12.523 --> 00:34:16.474
So,you,uh,you want to tell me
about this last hunt of yours?

00:34:17.534 --> 00:34:19.284
Nope. Not really.

00:34:21.353 --> 00:34:24.673
No offense. Just kind of a family thing.

00:34:25.264 --> 00:34:27.063
Not anymore.

00:34:27.963 --> 00:34:30.114
I got this stuff from ash.

00:34:32.193 --> 00:34:36.043
Andrew gallagher's house burned down on
his 6-Month birthday,just like your house.

00:34:36.753 --> 00:34:40.374
You think it was the demon both times,don't
you? You think it went after gallagher's family?

00:34:41.043 --> 00:34:42.463
Yeah,we think so. Sam.

00:34:42.463 --> 00:34:44.644
Why? None of your business.

00:34:44.983 --> 00:34:46.634
You mind your tongue with me,boy.

00:34:46.634 --> 00:34:48.664
This isn't just your war. This is war.

00:34:48.664 --> 00:34:52.164
Something big and bad is coming,and it's
coming fast,and their side holds all the cards.

00:34:52.164 --> 00:34:55.753
Now,at best,all we got is us -Together.

00:34:57.184 --> 00:34:59.583
No secrets or half-Truths here.

00:35:03.744 --> 00:35:05.923
There are people out there

00:35:05.923 --> 00:35:08.414
Like andy gallagher...

00:35:09.954 --> 00:35:12.394
Like me...

00:35:12.793 --> 00:35:15.184
And,um...

00:35:15.733 --> 00:35:17.943
We all have some kind of ability.

00:35:17.943 --> 00:35:19.583
Ability? Yeah.

00:35:19.583 --> 00:35:21.853
A psychic ability.

00:35:22.384 --> 00:35:24.923
Me,I have,um...

00:35:26.124 --> 00:35:28.434
I have visions...

00:35:28.864 --> 00:35:32.963
Premonitions. I don't know.
It's different for everybody.

00:35:35.534 --> 00:35:39.074
The demon said he had
plans for people like us.

00:35:39.074 --> 00:35:40.534
What kind of plans?

00:35:40.534 --> 00:35:41.753
We don't really know for sure.

00:35:41.753 --> 00:35:44.494
These people out there, these
psychics,are they dangerous?

00:35:44.494 --> 00:35:46.374
No.

00:35:46.374 --> 00:35:47.753
Not all of them.

00:35:47.753 --> 00:35:48.894
But some are. Some are very dangerous.

00:35:48.894 --> 00:35:50.244
How many?

00:35:50.244 --> 00:35:52.713
We've been able to track
a clear pattern so far.

00:35:52.713 --> 00:35:55.514
They've all had house fires on the
night of the kid's 6-Month birthday.

00:35:55.514 --> 00:35:57.614
That's not true.

00:35:58.353 --> 00:35:59.624
What?

00:35:59.624 --> 00:36:04.903
Webber or ansem weems or
whatever his name is --

00:36:06.273 --> 00:36:09.664
I looked at his files, and
there was no house fire.

00:36:10.054 --> 00:36:12.543
There's nothing out of the ordinary.

00:36:13.324 --> 00:36:16.724
